@EvoTech_HostAddress = http://localhost:4000

### Anonymous — expect 200 {"status":"ok"}
GET {{EvoTech_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ping/open
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated — expect 401 until step 5 issues tokens
GET {{EvoTech_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ping/secure
Accept: application/json

### The OpenAPI document — the contract the frontend generates its client from
GET {{EvoTech_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
